== A.1: who may seize a conclave's site (stance x refused-within-year)
  permitted refused=False -> sale only (6b)
  permitted refused=True  -> sale only (6b)
  endowed   refused=False -> nothing (the patron keeps its flock)
  endowed   refused=True  -> nothing (the patron keeps its flock)
  curbed    refused=False -> sale only (6b)
  curbed    refused=True  -> SEIZE (after the refusal)
  outlawed  refused=False -> SEIZE when the fork moves
  outlawed  refused=True  -> SEIZE when the fork moves
== A.4: the round-4 reclaim arithmetic that convicted (an unheard den)
  r4: lavish posture +0 -> reclaimScore 1 -> moves;  r5: no offer (the den is unheard)
  r4: funded posture +1 -> reclaimScore 1 -> moves;  r5: no offer (the den is unheard)
  r4: funded posture +0 -> reclaimScore 0 -> declines;  r5: no offer (the den is unheard)
